00:03:52.660 --> 00:03:54.220
He sings very well.

00:03:54.420 --> 00:03:57.080
It's a pity he doesn't go to the same schools.

00:03:57.450 --> 00:04:00.000
- You said it, doctor. - But that doesn't bother me.

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:04.000
I'm going to give up my career and devote myself fully to what I feel.

00:04:04.000 --> 00:04:07.000
- And what do you feel? - To sing.

00:04:07.000 --> 00:04:09.920
- An artist. - Why not, dad?

00:04:09.920 --> 00:04:12.840
- Alberto sings very well. - However, you shouldn't give up your life.

00:04:12.840 --> 00:04:17.210
- Apparently, the only one who thinks like me is Miss... - Irene.

00:04:17.210 --> 00:04:21.520
- With your permission, let's dance and keep talking. - Permit me.

00:04:21.520 --> 00:04:27.730
- This is a serious case, Alberto. - Yes, very serious.

00:04:27.730 --> 00:04:30.000
Well, I'm leaving. I'll be back today.

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:32.200
Our aunt Marisa, and she must be on her way to the train.

00:04:32.850 --> 00:04:33.430
Excuse me.

00:04:33.430 --> 00:04:40.440
There will be none, there will be none, none with your skin or with your nose.

00:04:41.830 --> 00:04:51.720
The magnolia that burned the moon, your voice, your whisper that impeded love.

00:04:51.720 --> 00:04:59.960
There will be none, there will be none, they all died from the moment you said goodbye.

00:05:00.440 --> 00:05:02.660
- Very good. - Do you really like the way I sing?

00:05:02.660 --> 00:05:04.660
I'm used to saying what I feel.

00:05:04.660 --> 00:05:06.660
I can't imagine how I value your words.

00:05:06.660 --> 00:05:09.680
Especially now that you need encouragement to decide.

00:05:09.680 --> 00:05:13.480
- Decide what? - To follow Eduardo's advice, a friend of mine.

00:05:13.480 --> 00:05:18.380
- And who is Eduardo? - An artist representative who wants to debut in a great show.

00:05:18.380 --> 00:05:22.380
Then don't doubt it. And especially if it's such an important show.

00:05:22.380 --> 00:05:26.530
Yes, but of great category, he told me. Yes, of great category.

00:05:57.480 --> 00:05:59.220
Come on, let's go!

00:06:00.250 --> 00:06:02.490
Come on, come on, come here.

00:06:02.490 --> 00:06:04.480
Come on, sir.

00:06:50.600 --> 00:06:55.830
a performance by a great singer.

00:07:01.180 --> 00:07:09.260
Don't worry, Alberto, don't worry.

00:07:09.800 --> 00:07:15.190
- Well, I'll tell you. - If you get to the bar, we'll hang you.

00:07:15.730 --> 00:07:21.600
And now, I leave with you the singer of the 100 neighborhoods.

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:24.870
Alberto Hernández, here, if you don't want to hang him.

00:07:49.290 --> 00:07:54.200
the friends and sisters who know what is slang, who know how to compare.

