I look like a pyrite, I'm like a pyrite

00:08:08.180 --> 00:08:12.220
Now a run, a turn, a sit

00:08:12.220 --> 00:08:15.430
That's how the tango dances, the tango of my flower

00:08:15.430 --> 00:08:18.950
