00:09:06.060 --> 00:09:08.060
So the tango is played

00:09:08.060 --> 00:09:10.060
A tango of my flower

00:09:38.160 --> 00:09:40.460
Follow these instructions and you'll get better soon.

00:09:40.660 --> 00:09:42.460
Thank you, doctor. See you on Wednesday.

00:09:42.660 --> 00:09:53.740
- Have a good day. - You too.

00:09:54.960 --> 00:09:57.820
Thinking of the others, I forget about myself.

00:09:57.940 --> 00:10:00.000
That's what I say. For you, no.

00:10:00.030 --> 00:10:05.540
The office closes at certain hours, and the patients must come another day.

00:10:05.540 --> 00:10:10.460
No, Marisa, no. The doctor is like a priest, and just as he follows his creed,

00:10:10.460 --> 00:10:13.180
we must follow our profession.

00:10:13.180 --> 00:10:15.220
It will be as you say, but...

00:10:15.220 --> 00:10:18.590
Well, let's leave that. Where is Irene?

00:10:18.590 --> 00:10:22.170
- Irene? She went out. - She went out alone?

00:10:22.170 --> 00:10:25.410
No, no, no. With a friend.

00:10:30.960 --> 00:10:34.250
- We have to talk to your father. - It would be useless, you don't know him well.

00:10:34.510 --> 00:10:39.810
- Until you have a well-formed position... - You're right, but tomorrow they'll test me on the radio.

00:10:40.070 --> 00:10:42.690
Eduardo talked to the director and says it's my great opportunity.

00:10:43.160 --> 00:10:45.860
- If God helps me with my son. - He will help you.

00:10:46.890 --> 00:10:51.490
Father, let's smoke while it's dark.

00:10:51.840 --> 00:11:00.000
Remember that like the smoke of the cigarette, youth is already leaving us.

00:11:01.370 --> 00:11:08.520
"My friend, you remember me, and I will remember you too."

00:11:09.090 --> 00:11:15.060
"The black girl attacked me, and she died."

00:11:19.990 --> 00:11:26.940
"Tormented by grief, she swore she was good."

00:11:27.170 --> 00:11:30.000
"And I didn't tell her why."

00:11:35.600 --> 00:11:55.330
I'm sure we needed you.

00:11:55.330 --> 00:11:57.750
I didn't tell you.

00:12:00.830 --> 00:12:03.830
♪ tormented by despair. ♪

00:12:03.830 --> 00:12:07.130
♪ She swore with love. ♪

00:12:07.130 --> 00:12:11.760
♪ And I didn't want to hear her cry. ♪

00:12:11.760 --> 00:12:17.370
♪ When I'm going to hurt her. ♪

00:12:17.370 --> 00:12:20.830
♪ Poor my dear. ♪

00:12:20.830 --> 00:12:25.070
♪ She must cry all her life. ♪

00:12:25.070 --> 00:12:28.430
It's an extraordinary value that will cause sensation.

00:12:28.430 --> 00:12:30.000
Uh-huh, tell me.

00:12:33.360 --> 00:12:35.580
- Congratulations. - Thank you very much, sir.

00:12:35.580 --> 00:12:39.120
I'm going to talk to Mr. Subiria so that he can include him in the next month's shows.

00:12:39.120 --> 00:12:41.960
- With great publicity, eh? - Who do I have to include?

00:12:41.960 --> 00:12:44.790
- Hello, Subiria, Mr... - Alberto Briones.

00:12:44.790 --> 00:12:47.070
- And what does the gentleman do? - The gentleman?

00:12:47.070 --> 00:12:49.450
The gentleman sings tangos.

00:12:49.450 --> 00:12:52.760
Please, stop with tango singers.

00:12:52.760 --> 00:12:55.920
- Vulgar imitators of Gardel. - Just a moment, sir.

00:12:55.920 --> 00:12:57.420
There was only one Gardel.

00:12:57.420 --> 00:12:59.320
And even if he wants, no one can imitate him.

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:03.970
- I just have my own style. - Yes, man, yes, but this is different.

00:13:03.970 --> 00:13:07.910
- Go, go listen to the test record. - Go, go, go to the office, go.

00:13:07.910 --> 00:13:10.960
- Look, we would like to talk... - Well, look, you come back tomorrow...

00:13:10.960 --> 00:13:13.810
...to sign the most important contract of your life.

00:13:13.810 --> 00:13:19.550
- He's going to be the exclusive artist of this station. - Tomás, what do you think, Cholito?

00:13:22.550 --> 00:13:30.000
- Oh, sorry, sorry. - I'm sorry, my friend.

00:13:30.000 --> 00:13:34.800
But I'm not interested in radial contracts or extraordinary propaganda.

00:13:34.800 --> 00:13:38.300
I accept the artist and admire him from the audience of a theater.

00:13:38.300 --> 00:13:40.500
But not as a member of my family.

00:13:40.500 --> 00:13:42.390
- Aníbal! - Dad!

00:13:42.390 --> 00:13:43.530
Listen to me, Irene.

00:13:43.530 --> 00:13:48.700
When your mother died, I betrayed the duty of being myself who marked the path of my children.

00:13:48.700 --> 00:13:53.730
Your brother has given me the greatest satisfaction of my life when he received me as a doctor.

00:13:53.730 --> 00:14:00.000
And I, in payment for all that, got him a position in the most important sanatorium in London.

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:02.920
You'll have to perfect your studies, son.

00:14:03.080 --> 00:14:06.140
- Dad... - Yes, my son, yes.

00:14:06.300 --> 00:14:08.080
It hurts me that you're leaving.

00:14:08.300 --> 00:14:13.610
Because maybe, maybe I won't see you again.

00:14:13.710 --> 00:14:17.310
But I feel very happy to know that all my sacrifices have not been in vain

00:14:17.410 --> 00:14:19.880
for giving you a name and a career.

00:14:19.980 --> 00:14:24.000
Thank you. Thank you, Dad.

00:14:25.690 --> 00:14:29.760
Sometimes parents seem a little stubborn and authoritarian, but...

00:14:30.510 --> 00:14:33.040
Time always gives us the right.

00:14:33.950 --> 00:14:37.890
And you, Alberto, if you really want my daughter, as you say,

00:14:37.950 --> 00:14:39.830
study and receive yourself.

00:14:40.040 --> 00:14:41.720
Don't give up.

00:14:41.730 --> 00:14:44.340
The crafty men always achieve what they want.

00:14:44.410 --> 00:14:46.520
Yes, Doctor, you're right.

00:14:47.370 --> 00:14:49.750
But one day I'll come back for your daughter, excuse me.

00:14:52.150 --> 00:14:58.120
- Mireia. - Juanjo.

00:14:58.320 --> 00:14:59.440
Juanjo.

00:15:00.190 --> 00:15:02.650
Come on, Eduardo, don't take it that way.

00:15:02.730 --> 00:15:04.370
Don't take it that way.

00:15:04.450 --> 00:15:07.460
I sacrifice myself, I make a living out of you.

00:15:07.460 --> 00:15:11.330
And when the contract comes that you can't get us out of Puro, you reject it.

00:15:11.330 --> 00:15:12.840
Who understands you?

00:15:12.890 --> 00:15:16.680
- Are you crazy? - Look, Eduardo, listen.

00:15:16.680 --> 00:15:19.170
When I heard you talk to Dr. Aníbal...

00:15:19.180 --> 00:15:21.460
- Yes. - ...it seemed to me that it was my old man who was recriminating me.

00:15:21.540 --> 00:15:23.160
- Yes. - And do you want me to tell you the truth?

00:15:23.240 --> 00:15:24.200
- No. - You're right.

00:15:24.280 --> 00:15:26.050
- No. - I'm going to receive you.

00:15:26.120 --> 00:15:30.000
And I'm going to study day and night, hour after hour, minute after minute.

00:15:30.440 --> 00:15:32.490
I don't want my head to get swollen.

00:15:32.590 --> 00:15:36.810
- More every day? - No, please.

00:15:36.910 --> 00:15:38.990
It all seems like a dream to me.

00:15:39.090 --> 00:15:41.620
To be Dr. Javier Paz's wife.

00:15:41.720 --> 00:15:44.740
- Not yet. - Well, no one can stop it anymore.

00:15:44.840 --> 00:15:48.960
- Maybe I regret it. - Come on, don't say it as a joke.

00:15:49.060 --> 00:15:51.350
Oh, and to be our honeymoon.

00:15:52.910 --> 00:15:55.910
Working. I have to keep the name of the Paz.

00:15:56.010 --> 00:15:57.630
Well, we agree on that, don't we?

00:15:57.730 --> 00:16:00.000
Because your father was very good to you.

00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:01.810
And I can't fail him, Olga.

00:16:02.010 --> 00:16:04.500
Fail him, by my side? Not even thinking about it.

00:16:04.700 --> 00:16:06.700
You'll be the most famous doctor in the world.

00:16:06.900 --> 00:16:08.480
May God hear you.

00:16:08.680 --> 00:16:10.690
But now, now I only think of one thing.

00:16:10.890 --> 00:16:13.530
- What? - The date of our marriage.

00:16:13.730 --> 00:16:15.450
Oh, Javier.

00:16:17.170 --> 00:16:19.740
And Aníbal, the same thing all his life.

00:16:19.940 --> 00:16:23.280
What need did he have to rush Javier's wedding?

00:16:23.480 --> 00:16:26.700
But Tía, you know he promised Javier he'd be back before a month.

00:16:26.900 --> 00:16:28.210
And that's what makes me angry.

00:16:28.410 --> 00:16:30.000
Could Javier have done the same thing?

00:16:30.030 --> 00:16:33.030
He has no right to take a position in our environment

00:16:33.030 --> 00:16:35.030
without the need to be separated from us.

00:16:35.030 --> 00:16:38.010
Of course he has the right, but it's not the same.

00:16:38.010 --> 00:16:40.880
This is a wonderful opportunity that dad put in his hands.

00:16:40.880 --> 00:16:44.870
Besides, I'm sure that the one who feels the most the distance from Javier is him.

00:16:44.870 --> 00:16:47.730
It will be as you say, but you don't convince me.

00:16:47.730 --> 00:16:50.330
What are you talking about, critic?

00:16:50.330 --> 00:16:53.340
Do you want to know? Well, I'm talking badly of you.

00:16:53.340 --> 00:16:55.280
No need to say it, I already imagined it.

00:16:55.280 --> 00:16:57.290
Don't listen to dad, they're just jokes.

00:16:57.290 --> 00:16:59.890
No, they're not jokes, no, but it's the same.

00:17:00.730 --> 00:17:04.300
- Listen, Irene, where is Javier? - He's at his husband's, isn't he?

00:17:04.480 --> 00:17:06.440
Of course, the poor man is in a hurry.

00:17:06.630 --> 00:17:09.630
He has to get married and travel in time.

00:17:09.790 --> 00:17:13.470
I warn you, Marisa, that I don't feel like arguing today.

00:17:13.630 --> 00:17:15.300
Well, it will be the first time.

00:17:15.630 --> 00:17:18.430
- Dad, do you know Marisa? - Oh, yes, I do.

00:17:18.590 --> 00:17:21.190
And that's why, because I know her, I don't take her into account.

00:17:22.300 --> 00:17:24.380
If Javier comes, tell him to wait for me at the office.

00:17:24.540 --> 00:17:28.160
- All right, Dad. - See you later, Marisa.

00:17:28.410 --> 00:17:30.000
See you later, Matasana.

00:17:30.120 --> 00:17:38.260
I'm sorry, but it can't be.

00:17:38.260 --> 00:17:40.500
The gentleman accepted the advertising budget.

00:17:40.500 --> 00:17:42.680
I'm sorry, but it can't be.

00:17:42.680 --> 00:17:47.750
Unless you have offers from another broadcaster, and in that case we double your salary.

00:17:47.750 --> 00:17:50.030
I'm sorry, but it can't be.

00:17:50.030 --> 00:17:51.030
We'll triple it.

00:17:51.030 --> 00:17:52.030
It's useless.

00:17:52.030 --> 00:17:54.710
I was very offended after the gentleman's words.

00:17:54.710 --> 00:17:56.850
I will never act in a radio show.

00:17:56.850 --> 00:17:58.210
Excuse me.

00:17:58.210 --> 00:18:00.000
You.

00:18:00.510 --> 00:18:02.510
- You have the right. - Me? - Yes.

00:18:02.510 --> 00:18:04.340
Enough of tango singers.

00:18:04.340 --> 00:18:06.610
And now present the resignation.

00:18:06.610 --> 00:18:09.460
Someone had to pay for the trouble I have on top.

00:18:19.220 --> 00:18:21.220
How many emotions, eh, Javier?

00:18:21.220 --> 00:18:28.010
The civil record, tonight the church, and in two days the plane.

00:18:28.010 --> 00:18:30.000
It's useless, Marisa, today we don't have it.

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:31.440
You will achieve your goal.

00:18:31.440 --> 00:18:33.440
Besides, dad, I am very grateful to you.

00:18:33.440 --> 00:18:35.440
We are grateful to you, doctor.

00:18:35.440 --> 00:18:37.330
But why are you grateful?

00:18:37.330 --> 00:18:39.190
Because you are going to cross the honey moon in a plane?

00:18:39.190 --> 00:18:41.190
No, no, because...

00:18:41.190 --> 00:18:44.010
getting the appointment for Javier...

00:18:44.010 --> 00:18:45.930
hastened our marriage.

00:18:45.930 --> 00:18:47.800
Now I'm more sure.

00:18:47.800 --> 00:18:49.750
I can't escape anymore.

00:18:51.750 --> 00:18:53.840
Listen to me, come on.

00:18:53.840 --> 00:18:55.840
Tell Javier that if I don't send him...

00:18:55.840 --> 00:18:57.840
it's because I didn't meet your dad.

00:18:57.840 --> 00:19:00.000
Don't take it, Amal. But you know what?

00:19:00.000 --> 00:19:02.720
I don't want to see you again until you pick me up.

00:19:02.720 --> 00:19:05.560
- Will it ever be? - The month that comes, you have to come in.

00:19:05.560 --> 00:19:12.250
- Let's go. - Come on, brother!

00:19:12.250 --> 00:19:14.900
It was about time!

00:19:14.900 --> 00:19:19.120
- Hey, but this one has to fix it. - Sorry, guys, but I have one more important thing to do.

00:19:19.120 --> 00:19:21.910
- Bye, bye! - Bye!

00:19:21.910 --> 00:19:24.690
- What's the matter? - The thing is that I'm becoming a father-in-law.

00:19:24.690 --> 00:19:27.310
- And a son-in-law! - And soon, I'll be a grandfather.

00:19:27.310 --> 00:19:30.000
- Dad!

00:19:46.890 --> 00:19:50.810
Remember when you debuted in that club, what was it called, like that.

00:19:50.810 --> 00:19:53.540
And we say it very loudly, with the tango, until death.

00:19:53.540 --> 00:19:56.120
Oh, buddy, there's no reason to be nervous.

00:19:56.120 --> 00:19:59.860
Aníbal, listen to what I'm going to tell you.

00:20:00.120 --> 00:20:01.980
I was with you when Javier was born.

00:20:02.180 --> 00:20:04.380
All men are the same. A lot of blah, blah, blah.

00:20:04.580 --> 00:20:07.580
But when the time comes, it's more important to attend to them

00:20:07.780 --> 00:20:09.080
than to the one who is going to be a mother.

00:20:09.280 --> 00:20:11.460
Doctor, stop!

00:20:37.420 --> 00:20:44.750
- What? - And you know, we have to produce.

00:20:45.750 --> 00:20:48.750
Yes, producer, I guess you'll rest for a while now.

00:20:49.750 --> 00:20:51.740
Rest, me? What hope!

00:20:52.740 --> 00:20:54.740
I don't stop until I form my own orchestra.

00:20:55.630 --> 00:20:56.630
And you know that I like very large ensembles.

00:20:57.640 --> 00:20:59.640
- How is that? - I don't know, doctor.

00:21:00.190 --> 00:21:04.450
- I'm not going to sing again. - Doctor, stop!

00:21:52.680 --> 00:21:55.080
to applaud your birthday brother, right?

00:21:55.080 --> 00:21:58.150
Oh, he is the most divine grandson in the world.

00:21:58.150 --> 00:22:00.000
Well, enough applause, and let's go

00:22:00.280 --> 00:22:02.440
But it's useless, Marisa, when will it change?

00:22:02.440 --> 00:22:04.980
But you don't know that doctors are to blame for their patients.

00:22:04.980 --> 00:22:10.120
Yes, but sometimes they have to rest, because if not the doctors become sick, and then

00:22:10.120 --> 00:22:11.120
who's going to cure the patients?

00:22:11.120 --> 00:22:16.120
Well, well, let's go, Gustavito, let's go find dad and leave this grumpy grandpa in

00:22:16.120 --> 00:22:17.120
peace.

00:22:17.120 --> 00:22:18.120
Let's go.

00:22:18.120 --> 00:22:19.120
Go easy, miss.

00:22:19.120 --> 00:22:30.000
With this competition, we're going to see who's going to win.

00:22:30.250 --> 00:22:33.170
and on Saturday you can go to the club to dance with your girlfriend.

00:22:33.170 --> 00:22:35.170
Thank you very much, doctor. Good afternoon.

00:22:35.170 --> 00:22:37.050
Good afternoon, miss.

00:23:00.220 --> 00:23:05.110
It's the birthday of the King of the House's little brother.

00:23:05.110 --> 00:23:07.110
How are you, my little gaucho?

00:23:07.110 --> 00:23:09.110
Every day more beautiful.

00:23:09.110 --> 00:23:11.110
Just like your father.

00:23:11.110 --> 00:23:13.110
How nice.

00:23:13.110 --> 00:23:15.400
A little kiss for daddy.

00:23:15.400 --> 00:23:17.400
A little kiss for aunt Marita.

00:23:17.400 --> 00:23:19.700
A little kiss for her.

00:23:19.700 --> 00:23:21.750
A little kiss for her.

00:23:21.750 --> 00:23:23.750
There you go.

00:23:23.750 --> 00:23:25.930
Another little kiss for her.

00:23:25.930 --> 00:23:27.930
How are you?

00:23:27.930 --> 00:23:29.920
How are you, doctor?

00:23:30.800 --> 00:23:33.680
Well, the same as before, I'm going to get the hooks.

00:23:33.760 --> 00:23:35.880
But don't be late, we're all in the dining room.

00:23:35.960 --> 00:23:36.720
Dining room.

00:23:38.750 --> 00:23:42.260
- Are we going with the little brother? - Let's go.

00:23:42.890 --> 00:23:45.750
- I'm delighted, Alberto. - A little.

00:23:45.790 --> 00:23:47.220
Today was a day of a lot of work.

00:23:47.610 --> 00:23:51.840
- How was the party at the Pire? - Not very nice, Alfonso.

00:23:51.860 --> 00:23:59.220
Are you happy, Irene?

00:24:01.020 --> 00:24:06.110
But I'm afraid, I don't want you to miss your vocation as a bishop.

00:24:06.430 --> 00:24:08.100
You're wrong.

00:24:08.230 --> 00:24:10.990
We doctors have a noble mission to fulfill.

00:24:11.260 --> 00:24:14.760
And when we achieve it, there's no greater satisfaction in the world.

00:24:14.780 --> 00:24:18.180
- Are you happy, then? - What else can you ask for in life?

00:24:18.500 --> 00:24:22.030
We have two boys who are a beauty, and I have you who are a treasure.

00:24:22.370 --> 00:24:24.870
Do you remember when we danced to the tango for the first time?

00:24:24.960 --> 00:24:26.380
How can I forget it?

00:24:26.730 --> 00:24:30.000
There will be no equal, there will be no...

00:24:31.120 --> 00:24:35.430
"None with your skin, nor with your voice."

00:24:39.500 --> 00:24:45.780
They fell asleep. They gave me a day today.

00:24:45.880 --> 00:24:47.880
Don't complain. They are charming.

00:24:47.980 --> 00:24:49.430
I said, but...

00:24:49.790 --> 00:24:50.960
Aníbal.

00:24:51.040 --> 00:24:51.960
Dad!

00:24:52.000 --> 00:24:53.640
What are you doing here at this hour?

00:24:53.740 --> 00:24:57.040
I have to get used to leaving the office early.

00:24:57.140 --> 00:24:58.290
What's wrong, Dad?

00:25:00.090 --> 00:25:05.500
My health, dear. Something I feared, and that the diagnosis confirmed.

00:25:05.500 --> 00:25:10.180
Come on, what you have is excess work. You need rest.

00:25:10.180 --> 00:25:14.300
Well, now I'm going to give you the reason.

00:25:14.300 --> 00:25:23.680
By medical prescription, daughter, I have been temporarily forbidden the exercise of my profession.

00:25:23.680 --> 00:25:26.810
Dad, don't take it like that. It won't be anything serious.

00:25:26.810 --> 00:25:30.000
It's just that the consultancy, the patients, the daily work...

00:25:30.760 --> 00:25:34.460
- They were part of my life. - I don't count for anything, do I?

00:25:34.580 --> 00:25:38.940
You have too many obligations at your age, dear, to complicate things with me.

00:25:40.000 --> 00:25:46.880
I'm going to be alone, Irene. Don't worry, dear. Don't worry.

00:25:47.010 --> 00:25:51.410
Very nice. Apparently, according to my brother, I'm nobody.

00:25:53.300 --> 00:25:58.320
Forgive me. I don't know what it would be like without you missing me.

00:26:07.580 --> 00:26:08.740
Yes, that's you, yes, yes.

00:26:09.360 --> 00:26:10.760
Eduardo!

00:26:10.860 --> 00:26:13.160
- Why did you come to hire me? - No, I came to check myself.

00:26:13.180 --> 00:26:16.260
Look, last night I drank a little, I think I have a liver to misery.

00:26:16.430 --> 00:26:20.610
I told you so many times, Eduardo, those strong dishes are not for you.

00:26:20.930 --> 00:26:24.150
Poor you, I'm better than ever.

00:26:24.380 --> 00:26:27.890
- What happens is that last night I mixed a lot, you know? - Yes, yes, yes, you mixed a lot.

00:26:28.230 --> 00:26:30.000
Come, come, lie down, let's see what happens to you.

00:26:30.700 --> 00:26:32.930
- You're going to check it, right? - Yes, yes, hurry up.

00:26:33.120 --> 00:26:34.520
But slowly, yes.

00:26:35.350 --> 00:26:37.160
- Wait. - Get up well.

00:26:37.240 --> 00:26:40.320
- I'm better, yes. - Good, good, stand up and don't talk so much, let's go.

00:26:40.400 --> 00:26:42.460
Well, that's it.

00:26:43.320 --> 00:26:45.570
- Aya. - What Aya, what Aya?

00:26:45.650 --> 00:26:47.790
- Aya. - What Aya or Oya?

00:26:47.910 --> 00:26:49.390
Aya, ay!

00:26:49.620 --> 00:26:51.540
- Oy, oy, oy! - And you said you were fine?

00:26:51.620 --> 00:26:54.100
- Oy, oy, ay! - Eduardo.

00:26:54.180 --> 00:26:56.300
- What? - You have the liver in misery.

00:26:56.380 --> 00:26:59.030
- Aha. - The mixtures are over since today.

00:26:59.170 --> 00:27:00.000
Vegetables and...

00:27:00.000 --> 00:27:03.200
...and roasted meat, and some pills before the meal.

00:27:03.200 --> 00:27:06.640
If you want roasted meat, I have something serious, right?

00:27:06.640 --> 00:27:10.500
Don't worry. Bad herbs never die.

00:27:10.500 --> 00:27:11.650
I hear you.

00:27:11.650 --> 00:27:15.750
Alberto, give me seven mayonnaise.

00:27:15.750 --> 00:27:24.000
You know, Berurguita, I don't like it.

00:27:25.320 --> 00:27:28.700
So, daddy, for the third time, here you go.

00:27:28.700 --> 00:27:30.000
Yes, but this time...

00:27:30.190 --> 00:27:33.130
- I want a girl. - It's pretentious, isn't it?

00:27:34.170 --> 00:27:36.690
- Mr. Leone, please. - Yes?

00:28:24.250 --> 00:28:29.860
for three years I will not see them again, but I imagine that they will behave well

00:28:30.000 --> 00:28:32.440
And don't give Aunt Marisa headaches, okay?

00:28:33.100 --> 00:28:36.820
What I don't know is how I'm going to get along with the North Americans.

00:28:37.110 --> 00:28:38.910
They couldn't go to study Spanish.

00:28:40.150 --> 00:28:42.570
But is that Christmas turkey coming or not?

00:28:42.570 --> 00:28:44.150
Yes, Doctor Ruñón, yes.

00:28:44.150 --> 00:28:46.550
And leave that letter, you've read it more than a hundred times.

00:28:46.550 --> 00:28:47.530
It's not for nothing.

00:28:47.530 --> 00:28:50.570
Javier is currently a personality in the field of medicine.

00:28:50.630 --> 00:28:53.910
It's just that reading his letter, I feel closer to him.

00:28:53.910 --> 00:28:58.450
Well, cheer up, Espíritu, let dad sing!

00:28:58.450 --> 00:29:00.000
Happy New Year!

00:29:00.440 --> 00:29:04.420
New Year, let's all sing!

00:29:04.420 --> 00:29:07.240
New Year, new life

00:29:07.240 --> 00:29:10.320
The happiest days will be

00:29:10.320 --> 00:29:14.320
New Year, new life

00:29:14.320 --> 00:29:17.320
With health and prosperity

00:29:17.320 --> 00:29:19.170
Between pittos and matracas

00:29:19.170 --> 00:29:21.170
Between music and smiles

00:29:21.170 --> 00:29:23.170
The clock has already told us

00:29:23.170 --> 00:29:24.180
That a new year has arrived

00:29:24.180 --> 00:29:26.180
Women and men

00:29:26.180 --> 00:29:28.180
We will give each other a little kiss

00:29:28.180 --> 00:29:30.000
And we will all sing together

00:29:30.190 --> 00:29:32.490
of happiness

00:29:32.490 --> 00:29:36.010
let's all sing

00:29:36.010 --> 00:29:39.490
New Year, new life

00:29:39.490 --> 00:29:42.890
let's leave our sorrow behind

00:29:42.890 --> 00:29:46.290
New Year, new life

00:29:46.290 --> 00:29:49.770
with health and prosperity

00:29:49.770 --> 00:29:53.270
New Year, new life

00:29:53.270 --> 00:29:56.480
let's leave our sorrow behind

00:29:56.480 --> 00:30:00.000
without problems, without sadness

00:30:00.250 --> 00:30:11.780
Happy New Year!

00:30:33.000 --> 00:30:35.840
- Did the boy go to Viau? - No, he was waiting for you.

00:30:37.510 --> 00:30:40.570
- Follow these instructions, ma'am. - Thank you, doctor. Good afternoon.

00:30:40.570 --> 00:30:42.320
Good afternoon.

00:31:19.740 --> 00:31:24.040
- Hello, Mr. Animal. - Very well, Alberto, very well.

00:31:24.040 --> 00:31:27.880
- Did you know I received letters from your children? - What do your grandchildren say?

00:31:27.880 --> 00:31:30.000
That they are very well, that Marisa takes care of them...

00:31:30.000 --> 00:31:32.120
But what? You haven't written to him?

00:31:32.120 --> 00:31:34.950
Yes, I have, and he sent me a beautiful picture...

00:31:34.950 --> 00:31:36.810
...that they took on Fifth Avenue.

00:31:36.810 --> 00:31:38.810
Well, they sent me a much better one...

00:31:38.810 --> 00:31:41.670
...seeing a boxing match in the Madison Square Garden.

00:31:42.670 --> 00:31:45.590
Sorry, but the best picture was sent to your father.

00:31:45.590 --> 00:31:52.570
What do you think if we discuss that personally?

00:31:52.570 --> 00:31:54.710
I'll take the pictures and you invite me to have coffee.

00:31:54.710 --> 00:31:56.690
- Agree? - Very well, I agree.

00:31:56.690 --> 00:31:58.840
See you later.

00:32:09.530 --> 00:32:15.000
I'm glad you're here, Ricardito. You're a man now.

00:32:15.000 --> 00:32:27.380
Every day reminds me of your father.

00:32:27.380 --> 00:32:30.000
Doctor, did he beat me?

00:32:30.060 --> 00:32:35.890
- You know it's not the same. - What's the matter with you two?

00:32:37.910 --> 00:32:39.230
Javier's letter.

00:32:40.190 --> 00:32:41.810
Soon this year they can come.

00:32:42.060 --> 00:32:44.730
His occupations don't allow him to leave for the moment.

00:32:44.840 --> 00:32:46.930
I don't know if this year will be the next one.

00:32:47.260 --> 00:32:49.460
Think that soon we'll have the puppies again.

00:32:49.620 --> 00:32:58.040
Give me a hand, please.

00:33:04.570 --> 00:33:06.570
- What's up, doctor? - Well, we're going, it's late.

00:33:06.570 --> 00:33:08.570
- Let's go, doctor? - No, you go.

00:33:08.570 --> 00:33:11.550
I stay here giving the last touches and separate the gifts.

00:33:11.550 --> 00:33:13.550
- Well, well, see you later. - See you later.

00:33:13.550 --> 00:33:18.240
- See you later. - Where are you going, over here?

00:33:26.250 --> 00:33:28.260
I'm going, I'm going, I'm going.

00:34:01.660 --> 00:34:04.060
They're calling us. The boys want to talk to you.

00:34:04.600 --> 00:34:06.060
Go up to the bank. Let's go.

00:34:19.070 --> 00:34:21.150
- How are you, Marisa? - Where are you going?

00:34:21.210 --> 00:34:24.120
- I want to talk to you. - Who, me?

00:34:24.160 --> 00:34:25.540
- Are you okay, father? - Okay.

00:34:25.580 --> 00:34:26.850
Very well, very well.

00:34:26.950 --> 00:34:28.440
Yes, but this is my family, huh?

00:34:28.720 --> 00:34:30.000
- I think it's... - Who is it?

00:34:31.980 --> 00:34:34.640
- Balpunti didn't come. - He stayed at home preparing the reception.

00:34:34.640 --> 00:34:35.640
Oh, well.

00:34:35.640 --> 00:34:36.640
Listen to me, dad.

00:34:36.640 --> 00:34:40.830
You have to get me permission to take out of the adobe a precious combination that Richard bought.

00:34:40.830 --> 00:34:44.460
And we also have some recordings that are already modern, which are madness.

00:34:44.460 --> 00:34:47.960
Oh, every rock and every calypso. Fabulous!

00:34:49.960 --> 00:34:52.400
Just a moment, please. Let's go aside.

00:34:52.400 --> 00:34:54.970
The combination? Go ahead and pass.

00:34:54.970 --> 00:34:58.870
But the rocks and calypso don't come into my house.

00:35:30.250 --> 00:35:35.990
Hey there, got a man.

00:36:00.160 --> 00:36:01.460
Never mind.

00:36:30.670 --> 00:36:34.340
I told you I don't like it when you interrupt me while I'm studying!

00:36:34.340 --> 00:36:38.030
Oh, no, sir. I didn't want to bother you.

00:36:38.030 --> 00:36:40.030
Give me your glasses and let me study!

00:36:40.030 --> 00:36:42.030
Can you tell me what's going on?

00:36:42.030 --> 00:36:44.530
What's going on is that Irene doesn't let me study!

00:36:44.530 --> 00:36:46.030
And that's why you scream so much!

00:36:46.030 --> 00:36:48.030
The only thing missing is for her to be right!

00:36:48.030 --> 00:36:50.030
I don't give the right to those who scream!

00:36:50.030 --> 00:36:51.920
And she still makes fun of me!

00:36:51.920 --> 00:36:55.670
I don't believe that Irene is capable of such a thing.

00:36:55.670 --> 00:36:56.670
Oh, no!

00:36:56.670 --> 00:37:00.000
That said, she is always right!

00:37:00.190 --> 00:37:11.930
It doesn't mean that you have cheated on me.

00:37:11.950 --> 00:37:13.750
I saw you when you were making fun of Gustavo.

00:37:13.770 --> 00:37:15.720
-And that? -And nothing.

00:37:15.720 --> 00:37:17.760
It's not fair that you make fun of a brother

00:37:17.780 --> 00:37:20.800
who is unable to make a bad joke.

00:37:45.100 --> 00:37:51.770
Is it possible that I can't have a moment of tranquility?

00:37:51.770 --> 00:37:53.770
Don't you feel ashamed, big guy?

00:37:53.770 --> 00:37:57.080
And I don't want to hear it again.

00:37:57.080 --> 00:37:59.000
Don't be angry, little sister.

00:37:59.000 --> 00:38:00.000
Eye for eye...

00:38:00.000 --> 00:38:01.200
I have a novelty.

00:38:01.400 --> 00:38:03.260
- A novelty? - You don't know who I met.

00:38:03.460 --> 00:38:04.850
- Who? - Mary.

00:38:05.050 --> 00:38:07.050
- Mary, the... - The same, what do you say?

00:38:07.250 --> 00:38:09.850
- Phenomenon. - Not so much Phenomenon that you don't run in that race.

00:38:10.050 --> 00:38:12.050
- They erased you before you left. - But it's that...

00:38:12.250 --> 00:38:15.050
It's that you shut up, in addition to the memory with that older brother,

00:38:15.250 --> 00:38:17.250
- and you owe me respect. - But I like it.

00:38:17.450 --> 00:38:19.450
I like it too, but I saw it first.

00:38:19.650 --> 00:38:21.650
- And? - And we didn't talk about it together.

00:38:21.850 --> 00:38:28.230
- Irene, you have to do me a favor. - Who? Me?

00:38:28.430 --> 00:38:30.000
You, what are you?

00:38:30.220 --> 00:38:32.520
You're going to invite her to have tea with us.

00:38:32.620 --> 00:38:37.170
- I don't know how. - Calling her on the phone, huh?

00:38:37.480 --> 00:38:40.350
- What did you call her? - Timito Asiño.

00:38:41.080 --> 00:38:44.630
And I, you're coming too, okay?

00:38:44.660 --> 00:38:48.990
- I don't know. I'll think about it. - We'll think about it.

00:38:53.850 --> 00:38:56.760
I can't imagine how happy I was to know you had come back.

00:38:56.800 --> 00:39:00.000
It's a pity you can't come with us to the cinema.

00:39:00.730 --> 00:39:02.750
I have my dance class.

00:39:02.750 --> 00:39:04.750
Why don't you sign up too?

00:39:04.750 --> 00:39:05.570
I'll pass.

00:39:05.570 --> 00:39:08.670
I...

00:39:08.670 --> 00:39:10.100
I'll pass.

00:39:10.100 --> 00:39:11.210
I won't.

00:39:11.210 --> 00:39:13.270
From tomorrow, I'll be just one more student.

00:39:13.270 --> 00:39:14.400
Perfect.

00:39:14.400 --> 00:39:15.400
We'll go together.

00:39:15.400 --> 00:39:16.610
Agreed?

00:39:16.610 --> 00:39:22.640
Completely agreed.

00:39:31.020 --> 00:39:40.980
Come back, come back, I miss you, kiss your eyes, I shine, and all the love that once was mine, come back, come back, come back.

00:40:00.000 --> 00:40:10.460
Come back, come back, come back, night and day I sit and pray, and hope to ride a phone

00:40:10.460 --> 00:40:24.260
to say come back, come back, come back, come back, come back, come back, I miss you honey

00:40:24.260 --> 00:40:30.000
without a doubt, come back, come back, I need your arms so hold me tight, will I stay

00:40:30.380 --> 00:40:35.030
I'm gonna make him cry all night, come back, come back, come back

00:40:35.030 --> 00:40:43.430
I'm so lonely all by myself, come back, come back

00:40:43.430 --> 00:40:47.430
You ain't left me upon the shelf, come back, come back

00:40:47.430 --> 00:40:54.450
I miss you, kiss your eyes that shine and all the love that once was mine, come back, come back

00:40:54.450 --> 00:40:56.600
Enough for today.

00:40:56.600 --> 00:40:58.610
Of course, now we could go dancing, right?

00:40:58.610 --> 00:41:00.000
More yet!

00:41:00.060 --> 00:41:03.160
another kind of dance, more intimate, a confectionery, for example.

00:41:03.160 --> 00:41:07.080
Good idea, let's go then to look for Irene and Gustavo who are waiting for us.

00:41:07.080 --> 00:41:10.680
But if Irene and Gustavo asked me to excuse them because they have to

00:41:10.680 --> 00:41:15.940
accompany Aunt Marisa, they can't. If that's the case, let's go alone, okay?

00:41:15.940 --> 00:41:18.420
Okay, I'm going to change, okay?

00:41:24.370 --> 00:41:30.000
...convince Aníbal to leave his case and come live with us. I don't like to let them

00:41:30.000 --> 00:41:33.500
You can't abandon me. Now I need you more than ever.

00:41:33.500 --> 00:41:36.290
- Bon appétit. - Grandpa!

00:41:36.290 --> 00:41:39.790
I felt lonely and I thought I might have time to have lunch with you.

00:41:39.790 --> 00:41:42.980
You always have time. This house is yours.

00:41:42.980 --> 00:42:00.000
- Always be a doctor. - We were talking, we don't understand each other.

00:42:00.000 --> 00:42:02.000
of coming to live with us.

00:42:02.000 --> 00:42:03.840
Listen to me, doctor.

00:42:03.840 --> 00:42:05.840
It's a way of not abandoning medicine completely.

00:42:05.840 --> 00:42:10.450
I would consult it periodically and it would be beneficial for me.

00:42:10.450 --> 00:42:11.450
Besides, grandpa,

00:42:11.450 --> 00:42:17.440
would you tell me things about mom in your free time?

00:42:39.020 --> 00:42:43.980
Hi, Almeri. Did you have a lot of fun this afternoon?

00:42:44.580 --> 00:42:45.940
Oh, I'm glad.

00:42:46.380 --> 00:42:49.790
Yes, yes, I understand.

00:42:50.160 --> 00:42:51.510
Well, wait, I'll go with him.

00:42:52.130 --> 00:42:53.130
Ricardo!

00:42:53.200 --> 00:42:55.650
Ricardo is taking a shower, but it doesn't matter.

00:42:56.430 --> 00:42:58.320
Let me take care of him.

00:43:03.550 --> 00:43:08.640
- Hello? - No, don't talk to me like that, Ricardo.

00:43:10.450 --> 00:43:13.060
Talk to me like that, Gustavo.

00:43:14.200 --> 00:43:16.070
Not like that, on the contrary.

00:43:18.200 --> 00:43:21.320
What happens is that my brother is a shameless man.

00:43:23.130 --> 00:43:27.740
- Me? - I would never let a girl like you.

00:43:29.030 --> 00:43:29.800
Him?

00:43:30.030 --> 00:43:33.080
Because he's a flower-pecker. He likes them all.

00:43:34.190 --> 00:43:37.100
- But me? - I know when I fall in love.

00:43:37.710 --> 00:43:39.650
Don't doubt it, Mary.

00:43:41.110 --> 00:43:43.860
How lovely, Mary.

00:43:44.460 --> 00:43:46.660
Oh, what are you saying, Mary?

00:43:47.560 --> 00:43:49.170
Please, Mary.

00:43:49.550 --> 00:43:51.510
Of course, Mary.

00:43:51.830 --> 00:43:53.580
At what time, Mary?

00:43:53.860 --> 00:43:56.490
Oh, I'll be right there, Mary.

00:43:57.220 --> 00:43:59.320
Forever, Mary.

00:44:08.760 --> 00:44:11.460
And I'm the one who's going to teach you how to respect your older sister.

00:44:11.460 --> 00:44:13.400
Wait a minute, Ricardo. You don't have the right.

00:44:13.400 --> 00:44:14.860
- You don't have the right. - You do.

00:44:14.860 --> 00:44:18.210
I'm going to teach you the incest of malnourishment.

00:44:18.210 --> 00:44:19.270
What's going on?

00:44:19.270 --> 00:44:24.110
I'm going to teach you the lesson of tomorrow. Come on, let's study, come on.

00:44:24.110 --> 00:44:26.030
I've already studied, I've already studied.

00:44:26.030 --> 00:44:27.030
How strange.

00:44:27.030 --> 00:44:30.000
It's the first time I've seen you so kind, that's how I like it.

00:44:31.020 --> 00:44:34.710
- Well, Ricardo, let's change for dinner. - Yes, aunt, right away.

00:44:38.160 --> 00:44:44.320
- I didn't think so. Were you fighting? - No, no, aunt, no.

00:44:44.400 --> 00:44:47.660
We were changing opinions. Opinions are opinions.

00:44:47.720 --> 00:44:52.300
Yes, but you have a way to change opinions very quickly.

00:44:54.820 --> 00:44:56.950
Forgive me, Eduardo, that I couldn't accompany you.

00:44:57.200 --> 00:44:59.800
- Until you entered the cinema. - Well, another time it was...

00:45:00.000 --> 00:45:03.520
- Do you know, Alberto, that my liver gets worse every day? - What will you do, too?

00:45:04.000 --> 00:45:05.400
- Get ready, I'll see you around. - Okay.

00:45:39.280 --> 00:45:40.720
I'm serious about this, okay?

00:45:40.720 --> 00:45:42.610
To strictly follow the rules.

00:45:42.610 --> 00:45:47.000
And you're going to take these pills, two every eight hours.

00:45:47.000 --> 00:45:48.610
The boys are happy, huh?

00:45:48.610 --> 00:45:51.610
Don't talk to me, this house is a manicomio.

00:45:51.610 --> 00:45:55.660
From morning to night, all I do is listen to postres, boogie boogie, rock and roll.

00:45:55.660 --> 00:45:57.670
But one of these days, I explode.

00:45:57.670 --> 00:46:00.000
Hey, you told me it's eight every two hours.

00:46:00.960 --> 00:46:05.640
- It's taking a while. - 8 every 2 hours.

00:46:05.640 --> 00:46:08.980
- 8 every 2 hours. - I'm not going to forget.

00:46:08.980 --> 00:46:12.980
- Son, what are you doing here? - Nothing, it doesn't matter, dad.

00:46:12.980 --> 00:46:15.430
Well, let's see if they stop listening to that crazy music

00:46:15.430 --> 00:46:17.800
and get ready that tonight I invite you to the movies.

00:46:17.800 --> 00:46:20.390
Oh, what a rush, dad, I want to see.

00:46:20.390 --> 00:46:23.170
- I want to see an Argentine movie. - Argentine?

00:46:23.170 --> 00:46:27.110
- Yes, musical and with some beautiful tangos. - Tangos?

00:46:27.110 --> 00:46:30.000
- But dad, tango has gone out of fashion. - You have to...

00:46:30.000 --> 00:46:33.320
- He wants to bury him. - Patience has a limit.

00:46:36.790 --> 00:46:38.320
I can't stand this anymore.

00:46:42.900 --> 00:46:45.270
I could have been wrong, but I don't understand why he got like this.

00:46:45.370 --> 00:46:47.670
- Yes, something is wrong. - We danced a little.

00:46:47.770 --> 00:46:50.780
- Nothing else? - I told you that tango had gone out of fashion.

00:46:50.880 --> 00:46:53.070
- And you wanted to bury him. - Do you think it's little?

00:46:53.170 --> 00:46:55.030
- What's wrong with it? - It has.

00:46:55.130 --> 00:46:58.370
It's time to start valuing what's ours without appreciating what's other people's.

00:46:58.550 --> 00:46:59.280
Got it?

00:47:00.000 --> 00:47:13.530
Are you crazy, Dad?

00:47:13.530 --> 00:47:17.060
No, too much work, clouds of smoke.

00:47:17.060 --> 00:47:20.230
- See you tomorrow, then. - See you tomorrow, darling.

00:48:00.890 --> 00:48:01.990
They're all the same.

00:48:02.810 --> 00:48:06.210
One sacrifices himself, pays them a career, and then forgets about their parents.

00:48:06.320 --> 00:48:07.630
Don't talk like that, Javier.

00:48:07.690 --> 00:48:09.060
I'm sure you owe me.

00:48:09.160 --> 00:48:10.660
I've lost hope.

00:48:10.780 --> 00:48:13.120
Maybe one of these days he'll show up here.

00:48:13.420 --> 00:48:14.770
I know why I'm telling you.

00:48:14.870 --> 00:48:15.870
Doctor Alberto!

00:48:17.020 --> 00:48:18.440
What's the matter, Teresa?

00:48:18.540 --> 00:48:20.240
Mr. Eduardo has come out of nowhere.

00:48:20.340 --> 00:48:22.040
He fainted when he entered the office.

00:48:22.400 --> 00:48:23.750
Where am I?

00:48:24.870 --> 00:48:26.270
Where am I?

00:48:27.920 --> 00:48:30.000
Where am I, please?

00:48:30.000 --> 00:48:32.940
Yes, yes, it's me. Stay calm.

00:48:32.940 --> 00:48:34.930
Please, leave me alone for a moment with him.

00:48:34.930 --> 00:48:36.960
Of course, doctor, if you want to stay.

00:48:36.960 --> 00:48:39.940
No, take care of yourself, colleague, I'm taking the Indian woman.

00:48:39.940 --> 00:48:41.040
Tell me, what happened to you?

00:48:41.040 --> 00:48:42.760
I don't know, I don't know.

00:48:42.760 --> 00:48:44.800
Doctors can't be deceived.

00:48:44.800 --> 00:48:47.570
- You had a miscarriage again. - I swear I didn't.

00:48:47.570 --> 00:48:49.610
- Did you follow my instructions? - At the foot of the letter.

00:48:49.610 --> 00:48:52.440
- Did you take the pills? - As you said twice.

00:48:52.440 --> 00:48:55.500
- Eight every two hours. - But no, two every eight hours.

00:48:55.500 --> 00:48:58.720
- Eight every two hours. - But you're crazy.

00:48:58.720 --> 00:49:00.000
I'm crazy, but you?

00:49:00.120 --> 00:49:03.220
- You said eight, not two! - You could've been dead!

00:49:03.220 --> 00:49:09.040
- Better... What? - Take this and stay calm.

00:49:09.040 --> 00:49:12.040
- You won't be wrong again. - Take it, take it, I tell you.

00:49:15.240 --> 00:49:18.500
- What an ugly taste! - From now on, absolute rest.

00:49:18.500 --> 00:49:21.300
A bag of ice and not moving for three days.

00:49:21.300 --> 00:49:25.010
Are you crazy? I have to organize the function for the theater house.

00:49:25.010 --> 00:49:27.610
If you don't rest, the benefit will be yours.

00:49:27.610 --> 00:49:30.000
I still haven't got the base number of the program.

00:49:30.800 --> 00:49:43.750
- Just kidding, unless you... - What do you mean?

00:49:43.750 --> 00:49:46.490
- That you could get me out of trouble. - Who, me?

00:49:46.490 --> 00:49:49.730
Yes, you, you can't deny it. It's a beneficial function.

00:49:49.730 --> 00:49:54.500
- You're crazy to sing after so long. - Where there was fire, there are ashes.

00:49:54.500 --> 00:49:57.670
- Get it out of your head, Eduardo. - Then I get up and I'll look for another figure.

00:49:57.670 --> 00:50:00.000
No, you don't get up, nor can I sing.

00:50:00.000 --> 00:50:02.300
- Why? - Because the audience wants well-known figures.

00:50:02.380 --> 00:50:03.910
But that doesn't matter to me.

00:50:04.000 --> 00:50:08.260
I announce a great party with a great surprise.

00:50:08.340 --> 00:50:10.520
- And the surprise is me. - Are you sure?

00:50:10.600 --> 00:50:13.460
I know how to sing well. You won't make me look bad.

00:50:13.540 --> 00:50:16.380
- Forgive me, but I can't please you. - Then I get up.

00:50:16.460 --> 00:50:22.290
I told you not to. And you don't move from my house for three days.

00:50:22.380 --> 00:50:24.580
Me in your house? And three days without leaving?

00:50:24.660 --> 00:50:28.010
- Yes, sir. It's necessary. - Then you can't fail me.

00:50:28.090 --> 00:50:29.860
If you have a tango in your soul,

00:50:30.120 --> 00:50:32.480
Are you going to tell me that you don't like to sing?

00:50:32.800 --> 00:50:35.060
Remember the test on the radio.

00:50:35.600 --> 00:50:36.960
Come on, Alberto.

00:50:37.020 --> 00:50:38.700
- Well, I... - You said yes.

00:50:38.900 --> 00:50:40.540
- I didn't say anything. - What do you mean, no?

00:50:40.740 --> 00:50:42.180
Well, that's fine, but on one condition.

00:50:42.380 --> 00:50:44.260
- What? - That my family doesn't find out.

00:50:44.460 --> 00:50:45.540
- Deal? - Deal.

00:50:46.370 --> 00:50:47.920
Doctor.

00:50:48.160 --> 00:50:49.560
Prepare a room for the gentleman.

00:50:49.760 --> 00:50:51.280
He'll stay with us for three days.

00:50:51.500 --> 00:50:52.500
Okay, doctor.

00:50:55.530 --> 00:50:57.730
As far as we're concerned, not even half a word.

00:50:57.930 --> 00:50:58.870
I promise.

00:51:05.050 --> 00:51:06.710
